      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 47:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.47.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.47.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that came to Jeremiah the prophet against the Philistines, before that Pharaoh smote Gaza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.47.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.47.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; Behold, waters rise up out of the north, and shall be an overflowing flood, and shall overflow the land, and all that is therein; the city, and them that dwell therein: then the men shall cry, and all the inhabitants of the land shall howl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 47:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At the noise of the stamping of the hoofs of his strong",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "horses",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.47.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.47.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", at the rushing of his chariots,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and at",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.47.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.47.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the rumbling of his wheels, the fathers shall not look back to",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "their",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.47.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.47.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "children for feebleness of hands;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 47:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because of the day that cometh to spoil all the Philistines,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.47.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.47.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to cut off from Tyrus and Zidon every helper that remaineth: for the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.47.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.47.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will spoil the Philistines, the remnant of the country of Caphtor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 47:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baldness is come upon Gaza; Ashkelon is cut off",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "with",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.47.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.47.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the remnant of their valley: how long wilt thou cut thyself?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O thou sword of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.47.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.47.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", how long",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "will it be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.47.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.47.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ere thou be quiet? put up thyself into thy scabbard, rest, and be still.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 47:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How can it be quiet, seeing the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.47.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.47.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath given it a charge against Ashkelon, and against the sea shore? there hath he appointed it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
